caption: Potence, Resource, and Limits
tradition-component: potence-resource-and-limits

Shadow Arts uses the practitioner's ordinary FP as its Jutsu activation resource. Pay every written fixed FP cost and every variable-parameter expense from FP; those points recover by the character's normal FP recovery rules unless another ability explicitly changes that recovery. Apply the universal Jutsu cap separately to every authored parameter: no parameter value used by the practitioner may exceed twice their Kung Fu Higher Purpose unless an explicit higher-level rule says otherwise.
